Welcome to my Sandbox :)

You can find the code I use for my graduation project here.
I am modelling the Stratified Inclined Duct (SID) experiment including Stokes particles.

The exchange flow through the duct takes long to start up, so first I simulate 100 time units without adding any particles using [this code](flow_t100.c). I generate a dumpfile every 10 time units, starting at t=50.
Using the dumpfile for the flow, I release the particles at t=101. They are organized in four groups: two densities and two release locations per density. Code can be found [here](particle_groups.c).